                    <div>
                        <h1 class="irm-hub-title">
                            Security<br>
                            <span class="gradient-text">Operations</span>
                        </h1>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p class="irm-hub-subtitle">
                    ServiceNow SecOps is a SOAR (Security Orchestration, Automation, and Response) platform 
                    that bridges IT security and IT operations. It ingests data from SIEM, scanners, and 
                    threat feeds, enriches it with CMDB business context, and orchestrates automated response.
                </p>
