            <div class="pages-grid">
                <a href="/secops/overview" class="module-card-horizontal page-card">
                    <span class="page-card-number">01</span>
                    <h3 class="page-card-title">Overview & Architecture</h3>
                    <p class="page-card-desc">
                        Understand what SecOps is, its SOAR capabilities, how it sits on the Now Platform, 
                        and the relationship between SIR, VR, and Threat Intelligence.
                    </p>
                    <div class="page-card-topics">
                        <span class="topic-tag">SOAR</span>
                        <span class="topic-tag">Architecture</span>
                        <span class="topic-tag">Core Modules</span>
                    </div>
                </a>

                <a href="/secops/data-model" class="module-card-horizontal page-card">
                    <span class="page-card-number">02</span>
                    <h3 class="page-card-title">Data Model & Key Tables</h3>
                    <p class="page-card-desc">
                        Deep-dive into sn_si, sn_vul, and sn_ti table families. Understand how 
                        security incidents, vulnerabilities, and observables are structured.
                    </p>
                    <div class="page-card-topics">
                        <span class="topic-tag">sn_si_incident</span>
                        <span class="topic-tag">sn_vul tables</span>
                        <span class="topic-tag">CMDB Links</span>
